==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 29.33~30 seconds<sup>880f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>, delay 29.33~30 seconds<sup>880f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 29.33~30 seconds<sup>880f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Vega (Enemy)|Vega]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

